1
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,000
[alarm beeping]

2
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:17,500
Captain Reyes: Tomas, why did you shut
down the oxygen recycler?

3
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:21,500
Tomas: I had no choice.
The core was overheating.

4
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Captain Reyes: You hid that from the crew
for three days.

5
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:31,500
Tomas: <i>I was trying to protect everyone.</i>

6
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,500
Captain Reyes: You were protecting yourself.
I know.

7
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:42,500
Tomas: Then you know we have
only six hours of air left.

8
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:48,000
Captain Reyes: Then we fix the core together,
starting now.

9
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:53,000
[music]

10
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:58,500
Tomas: Hand me the wrench.
This will take everything we have.